<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/1fad9bae3b69244c7ed319511f741806.poster.avif?t=1758816229\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/1fad9bae3b69244c7ed319511f741806.webm?t=1758816229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/1fad9bae3b69244c7ed319511f741806.mp4?t=1758816229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share a Piece of Your World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map Shards are powerful artifacts that allow players to share a piece of their world with others. Map Shards create a co-operative instance with random modifiers that unpredictably alters the monsters that inhabit the area and boost the loot they are guarding. When sharing the area with others, players can comment on it letting everyone know about what to expect in the area: vast riches or especially challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/fb43996bf68435279fcfc6bbb35e3e1e.poster.avif?t=1758816229\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/fb43996bf68435279fcfc6bbb35e3e1e.webm?t=1758816229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/fb43996bf68435279fcfc6bbb35e3e1e.mp4?t=1758816229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Challenging Bosses\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront powerful bosses that stand in your way. Battle the <strong>Treasure Golem</strong>, the mind-altering <strong>Rorsch</strong>, the imposing <strong>Ghostly Knight</strong>, and many more. Each boss encounter is a tough and deadly challenge where a single mistake can cost you a significant chunk of your health if played poorly. But every action in these fights is thoughtfully designed and well-telegraphed, so with practice, you can conquer even the greatest foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/b9d656573dbdc4cd67aab45c159b666d.poster.avif?t=1758816229\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/b9d656573dbdc4cd67aab45c159b666d.webm?t=1758816229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/extras/b9d656573dbdc4cd67aab45c159b666d.mp4?t=1758816229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fractured Worlds</strong> offers a journey through a broken reality, focusing on direct action and the task of restoring what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Laser Guided Games, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879860/82517739c7a265c4f88e607f1851cd4a0bb6f4f9/header.jpg?t=1758816229","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1879860/1414980767/cef838741fb980bb73aaf86f603c04e8288b8f13/1755020382